This is ZFServ, a file request handler
for Zeus Professional Bulletin Board
System. Because other available request
servers do not have all options which
ZFServ could have, we (Martin Wasley
and Bart Schraa) decided to write our
own one. 

ZFServ is designed as two seperate
utilities, the ZFServManager which is
the "managertask" running in the
background and ZFTell which can send a
message to ZFServManager's messageport.
Currently this is an ordinary
messageport, but it will be converted
to a ARexx messageport, which will make
things easier. 
